## 🌐 Blynk Web Dashboard Setup

Monitor and control your device directly from any web browser using the Blynk Web Dashboard.

### 1️⃣ Open Blynk Console

Visit:

https://blynk.cloud

Login to your Blynk account and open your device dashboard.

---

### 2️⃣ Create a Datastream

Navigate to:

```text
Template → Datastreams → New Datastream
```

Create the following datastream:

| Name | Pin | Type |
|--------|--------|--------|
| Relay | V0 | Integer |

Set:

```text
Min Value : 0
Max Value : 1
Default   : 0
```

---

### 3️⃣ Design the Dashboard

Navigate to:

```text
Web Dashboard → Edit
```

Add a:

- 🎛 Switch Widget

Configure:

| Setting | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Datastream | V0 |
| Mode | Switch |

Save the dashboard.

---

