---

### ⚡ Operation

```text
Switch ON  → Relay ON  → Bulb ON 💡

Switch OFF → Relay OFF → Bulb OFF 🌙
```

The Web Dashboard allows you to control appliances from any device with a browser, without requiring the mobile application.